        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Ex-con single mom Kiki rebuilds her life and regains custody of her teen daughter, until her violent drug-dealer ex returns. To protect herself and her daughter, she must eliminate him without getting caught.",
          "runtime": 90,
